    "Description": "The qt packages contain a software toolkit that simplifies the task of writing and maintaining Graphical User Interface (GUI) applications for the X Window System.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* qt: Qt: Denial of Service via out-of-bounds read in text codec handling (CVE-2026-9499)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
